s like  it's been really good food  so that's been absolutely wonderful some  other things worth noting is that  i've gotten probably two phone calls  every day a nurse  legally has to call me every single day  just to ask how i'm doing  so they call every day they ask if your  mental health is okay and if you're  feeling okay and if you have any covered  symptoms but today  um i actually was covered tested which  meant that nurses knocked on my door  um i had to put my mask on and walk out  they made me stand  flat against the door like kind of like  this  while they're there so i was facing a  head they were facing towards me  they made me take my mask off they  swabbed the back of my throat and then  both of my nostrils which  you know i have had happen a few times  now and it really does  it makes me sneeze every time and then  i'm so self-conscious about the fact  that i'm sneezing while just having had  a gopher test  i don't imagine i have covered uh but  they basically said if it tests negative  they won't even tell me  um if it tests positive then i'll get a  phone call in a couple of days and  they'll tell me that i do  i don't know what actually happens if  you do have covid um but i am fully  vaccinated i got  the moderna um in april on the 14th and  they didn't ask me about that they asked  me for the details of it but the idea is  that even if you're vaccinated you still  can catch and spread covet it just  wouldn't be anywhere near as severe  so that's why even though i'm vaccinated  i do have to be in the hotel as  frustrating as it feels to be like i'm  gonna be fine  other people might not be and australia  is very coveted free so i think that's  all the main details  yeah i get these three bags every day um  you can get stuff delivered  like i said my family delivered me stuff  and i just got this package from amazon  so i can do that  you you then put your um bags outside  when you're done  with them if you want anything change  like towels or sheets you call and ask  and they'll leave them outside and then  you have to change them yourself of  course  they gave us uh you can see them just  here 26 i think  bottles of water for free you can  order alcohol but there are limits on it  so you can have six beers a day  and one uh bottle of wine but i believe  that's just  uh they're like responsible liquor laws  effectively  i do have a fridge no mini bar  everything's been removed but i do have  a fridge so i can keep stuff in there if  i need to  but i have not really been ordering  anything because the food is really good  um but like i said i'm sure when it  starts to feel more repetitive because  i'm sure they only have a certain amount  of meals that they  make don't imagine it's 14 unique meals  that i'll probably start to get pretty  bored  so we'll see how that goes mentally i  really am fine  the one weird thing that's happening to  me  is that what i can see outside of this  window  my brain doesn't believe is real and i'm  already at that point  the things that i'm seeing outside of  this window  because it's a big window my brain is  convinced is a simulation or a screen  it's really weird but that is it for me  today everyone just kind of an update um  like i said let me know if you have any  questions and i'll probably post another  video about  how this is going or any updates that i  have next week so i guess i'll see you  then  bye
 

